      "block_id": "p005-r006-block",
      "parent_block_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "Chris Hanks – Managing Director Chris co-founded Coulton Creek Capital in 2013 and has led the company in deploying over $277 million of direct investments, building a diversified portfolio of private real estate equity and debt. Today, Chris leads the Coulton Creek team setting the strategic direction for the firm, as well guiding investment decisions for Coulton Creek. Before Coulton Creek, Chris was the CFO and COO of HealthTrans, a privately held pharmacy benefit manager. At HealthTrans, Chris helped grow revenue from $4 million to $300 million and raised $100 million in debt and equity to fund acquisitions and a minority recapitalization. Chris concluded his tenure with the company’s $250 million sale in January 2012.",
        "raw_text": "Chris Hanks – Managing Director\nChris co-founded Coulton Creek Capital in 2013 and has led the company in deploying over\n$277 million of direct investments, building a diversified portfolio of private real estate equity and\ndebt. Today, Chris leads the Coulton Creek team setting the strategic direction for the firm, as\nwell guiding investment decisions for Coulton Creek.\nBefore Coulton Creek, Chris was the CFO and COO of HealthTrans, a privately held pharmacy\nbenefit manager. At HealthTrans, Chris helped grow revenue from $4 million to $300 million and\nraised $100 million in debt and equity to fund acquisitions and a minority recapitalization. Chris\nconcluded his tenure with the company’s $250 million sale in January 2012.",
        "native_text": "Chris Hanks – Managing Director\nChris co-founded Coulton Creek Capital in 2013 and has led the company in deploying over\n$277 million of direct investments, building a diversified portfolio of private real estate equity and\ndebt. Today, Chris leads the Coulton Creek team setting the strategic direction for the firm, as\nwell guiding investment decisions for Coulton Creek.\nBefore Coulton Creek, Chris was the CFO and COO of HealthTrans, a privately held pharmacy\nbenefit manager. At HealthTrans, Chris helped grow revenue from $4 million to $300 million and\nraised $100 million in debt and equity to fund acquisitions and a minority recapitalization. Chris\nconcluded his tenure with the company’s $250 million sale in January 2012.",
        "visible_ocr_text": "Chris Hanks - Managing Director\nChris co-founded Coulton Creek Capital in 2013 and has led the company in deploying over\n$277 million of direct investments, building a diversified portfolio of private real estate equity and\ndebt. Today, Chris leads the Coulton Creek team setting the strategic direction for the firm, as\nwell guiding investment decisions for Coulton Creek.\nBefore Coulton Creek, Chris was the CFO and COO of HealthTrans, a privately held pharmacy\nbenefit manager. At HealthTrans, Chris helped grow revenue from $4 million to $300 million and\nraised $100 million in debt and equity to fund acquisitions and a minority recapitalization. Chris\nconcluded his tenure with the company's $250 million sale in January 2012.",
        "native_ocr_token_agreement": 1.0
