      "parent_block_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "Will Hensley – Director Will joined Coulton Creek Capital as the third employee in 2015. During his tenure, Will has been involved in almost every aspect of Coulton Creek. In his current role as Director, Will is responsible for sourcing new investment opportunities, as well as underwriting, due diligence and portfolio management duties. Prior to joining Coulton Creek, Will worked in commercial banking where he acquired a diverse skill set included underwriting and portfolio management, as well as experience and oversight of distressed real estate assets.",
