        "text": "Scott Brown – Director Scott joined Coulton Creek Capital as a Director in 2022. Scott is responsible for sourcing and underwriting new real estate investment opportunities as well as assisting in portfolio management and investor relations responsibilities. Prior to joining Coulton Creek, Scott worked at Real Capital Solutions, a Colorado-based real estate family office. Scott served as a member of RCS’ Investment Committee evaluating the risks, cash flows, capital requirements, deal structuring, and the overall status of RCS’ portfolio.",
